    <string name="about_what_title">What is Amor&amp;Contas?</string>
    <string name="about_what_text">Amor&amp;Contas helps couples split shared expenses with clarity, fairness, and less stress in day-to-day money conversations.</string>
    <string name="about_why_title">Why this app was built</string>
    <string name="about_why_text">The goal is to avoid confusion and friction when splitting bills by making totals, fair share, and settlement simple to understand.</string>
    <string name="about_when5050_title">When to use 50/50</string>
    <string name="about_when5050_text">Use 50/50 when both people want equal contribution regardless of earnings. It is fast, predictable, and great for simple routines.</string>
    <string name="about_automatic_title">Why use Automatic (Scale)</string>
    <string name="about_automatic_text">Automatic mode uses scale values so each person contributes proportionally. If you set the net income of each person as the scale, both pay the same burden relative to income—almost like paying with work time instead of just money.</string>
    <string name="about_suggestions_title">Usage suggestions</string>
    <string name="about_suggestions_text">Register expenses as they happen, review settlement weekly, and share the result before paying to keep both sides aligned.</string>
    <string name="about_nav_title">About Amor&amp;Contas</string>
